00:23:25.360 --> 00:23:26.700
Marukawa publishing glossary!

00:23:26.700 --> 00:23:27.900
Today's word is republication.

00:23:27.900 --> 00:23:29.590
Republication means taking an already...

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:31.840
...published work and putting it on the market again.

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:33.260
It's also known as reprinting.

00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:36.350
Sometimes, republication prints are made as split-runs.

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:40.120
When a book is republished, the information in the imprint is updated.
